5743	RISK-1218	A0987_Gipiškis2024	Sandboxing of AI Systems	Testing & Auditing	AI systems can be developed and tested within a sandbox, (a secure and iso- lated environment used for separating running programs), such that outside access to information within the sandbox is restricted. Within this environ- ment, resources such as storage and memory space, and network access, would be disallowed or heavily restricted [15]. With sandboxing, dangerous or harmful outputs generated during testing will be contained.
