11904	RISK-163	A0991_Gipiškis2024	Knowledge unlearning techniques	Model Safety Engineering	Knowledge unlearning techniques allow specific information to be “forgotten” without the need for retraining the entire model, preserving its general capabil- ities. These techniques can be used to reduce privacy risks and protect against copyrighted or harmful content [96, 188].
