14152	RISK-636	A0931_UK Government2023	Limitations of Input Data Audit	Data Governance	Acknowledge the limitations of input data audit. Techniques for understanding the impacts of data and filtering out specific data are limited (e.g. excluding information from a dataset does not always prevent the AI system from reasoning about or discovering that information). Other risk mitigation measures will be required and further research on improving data input audit techniques is important.
