13074	RISK-674	A0972_Gipiškis2024	Release strategy disagreement between developers	Governance Disclosure	Developers of restricted-access models with similar capabilities may disagree about the strategy or precautions to take for model release, especially in the case of competitive pressure or minimal safety regulation oversight. In such a case, if only a single developer releases an equally capable model unrestricted, malicious actors can use it instead of restricted-access alternatives [88].
