14170	RISK-834	A0920_UK Government2023	Audits for Harmful Content	Data Governance	Harmful content, such as child sexual abuse materials, hate speech, or online abuse. Having a better understanding of harmful content in datasets can inform safety measures (e.g. by highlighting domains where additional safeguards like content filters should be applied).
