11406	RISK-270	A0779_UK Government2023	Reversible and Small-Scale Deployment	Staged Deployment	Deploy models in small-scale or reversible ways before deploying models in large-scale or irreversible ways. This makes it possible for frontier AI organisations to notice and mitigate harm before the harm becomes too large or unavoidable.
