10972	RISK-334	A0975_Gipiškis2024	AI output watermaking	Content Safety Controls	Output produced by or with AI assistance can be marked to clearly identify its origin. Verification of the watermark can involve the use of statistical tests or having the mark immediately visible to a human inspector. Ideally, the watermark does not significantly alter the utility of the output, and is robust against digital and physical manipulation that results in data degradation [216, 145].
