13899	RISK-400	A0928_UK Government2023	Removal of Harmful Input Data	Data Governance	Remove potentially harmful or undesirable input data, where appropriate. Given the increasingly strong generalisation abilities of AI systems, data curation may prove insufficient to prevent dangerous system behaviour but could provide an additional layer of defence alongside other measures such as fine-tuning and content filters.
