13996	RISK-732	A0930_UK Government2023	Sourcing or Generation of Additional Data for Training Dataset	Data Governance	Consider sourcing or generating additional data and adding it to the training dataset, where it is determined that data is missing or inadequate. Improving the representativeness of training data can improve performance and reduce potential negative societal impacts and discriminatory effects. However, additional data should only be sought through appropriate means that respect and empower those individuals who are missing from the data.
