2178	RISK-862	A0936_Gipiškis2024	Adversarial training	Model Safety Engineering	Adversarial training [83] is a technique for training AI models in which adver- sarial inputs are generated for a model, and the model is then trained to give the correct outputs for those adversarial inputs.Adversarial training can involve adversarial examples generated by human experts, human users, or other AI systems.
2179	RISK-862	A0953_Gipiškis2024	Evaluations for truthful outputs	Testing & Auditing	AI systems can be evaluated for truthfulness when answering questions, includ- ing in contexts where humans tend to give incorrect but widely-accepted answers (i.e., popular misconceptions). Evaluations detect incorrect facts learned about the world, inadequate capabilities of the AI system, and misleading outputs by the AI system [121].
